  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math> be a solution of the differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;Where, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mo>Lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "does not exist",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Which is a linear differential equation,</p><p>So, integrating factor will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>So, the solution of differential equation is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now finding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as&#160;</mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
